#. module: website_generator_sale
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_website_generator_sale
msgid ""
"\n"
"Extension of the Website Generator.\n"
"Generate products in Odoo based on the products found on the external "
"website.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"ສ່ວນຂະຫຍາຍຂອງຕົວສ້າງເວັບໄຊ.\n"
"ສ້າງສິນຄ້າໃນ Odoo ໂດຍອີງຕາມສິນຄ້າທີ່ພົບເຫັນຢູ່ໃນເວັບໄຊພາຍນອກ.\n"

#. module: website_generator_sale
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:website_generator_sale.import_products_shop
